{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/273a5b5cc76c5e94aaadf853192c2da6.avif?t=1768499417\" width=616 height=89 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>math is hard</strong>\u00a0makes you put to the test your math skills and logical thinking, pushing blocks around the grid solving puzzles. Simple addition and subtraction won't always do the trick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/d9bcc8b99329a176b85a53a87879fb89.poster.avif?t=1768499417\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/d9bcc8b99329a176b85a53a87879fb89.webm?t=1768499417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/d9bcc8b99329a176b85a53a87879fb89.mp4?t=1768499417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/4d7bec9627ba9a5948260bfa3cdcad37.avif?t=1768499417\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has planned over 50 levels. Going through locked doors or sliding on ice and using different combinations of operations (+, \u2013, \u00d7, \u00f7) you must reach the target value. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/37abaaa7029e60e06c638b76833bd2bc.poster.avif?t=1768499417\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/37abaaa7029e60e06c638b76833bd2bc.webm?t=1768499417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/37abaaa7029e60e06c638b76833bd2bc.mp4?t=1768499417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/9afb3d415126ff6837cce5cda625c38d.avif?t=1768499417\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>math is hard</strong> challenges both your head for numbers and your eye for strategy. Ready to prove that, with the right moves, math really isn\u2019t so hard after all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/492078373b538f622bb0258954219c19.poster.avif?t=1768499417\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/492078373b538f622bb0258954219c19.webm?t=1768499417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/492078373b538f622bb0258954219c19.mp4?t=1768499417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was originally created for and won the MiniJam 183: Calculations.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739920?t=1768499417","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739920?t=1768499417","capsule_image":"https://shared.akama